OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FHeavy,
OL,6,Fthundery showers gradually fading
OL,7,Fduring the evening but some lighter
OL,8,Fones continuing overnight. Clear
OL,9,Fspells developing in between with
OL,10,Fwinds easing. Less muggy than recent
OL,11,Fnights.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FFine for much of Friday with
OL,14,Fsunny spells and variable cloud.
OL,15,FMostly dry but some isolated showers
OL,16,Fpossible along the coast and then more
OL,17,Fbroadly into the evening. Feeling
OL,18,Ffresher.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
